<!--METHOD
The data comes from the publicly published price lists of Bratislava developers, which Residata reads daily, flat by flat. Supply consists of available and reserved flats in active projects; homes only — no parking, storage or commercial units. Prices and floor areas are means over the flats whose developer publishes a price. Price levels are computed as the mean of daily values over the last two weeks of the quarter. Projects are assigned to a district by the borough they stand in; flats in projects whose borough we do not record are listed separately in the Neuvedené row and are not added to any district.
